 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Before the noun",
     "texto": [
      "Before the noun we use the short forms: **acest tricou** («this T-shirt»), **această bluză**, **acești pantofi**, **aceste rochii**. The noun takes no definite article. **Tricou** is neuter: the demonstrative has the masculine form in the singular (**acest tricou**) and the feminine form in the plural (**aceste tricouri**)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«This» or «that»",
     "texto": [
      "**Acest, această, acești, aceste** show closeness; **acel, acea, acei, acele**, distance. If the demonstrative replaces the noun, the full form is used: **acesta** («this one (masculine)»), **aceasta** («this one (feminine)»), **aceștia** («these ones (masculine)»), **acestea** («these ones (feminine)»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
